{
 "duration": 23.886,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Mark's favorite wool socks came out of the dryer a size too small.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 4.008
  },
  {
   "text": "On the trail they slid down, bunched at the heel, and by mile three he had a hot spot.",
   "start": 4.308,
   "end": 9.238
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 9.588,
   "end": 10.515
  },
  {
   "text": "Wash wool socks inside out, on a cool wool cycle or by hand.",
   "start": 10.815,
   "end": 14.781
  },
  {
   "text": "No tumble dryer. Dry them flat overnight.",
   "start": 15.131,
   "end": 17.847
  },
  {
   "text": "And always pack a dry spare pair.",
   "start": 18.197,
   "end": 19.915
  },
  {
   "text": "His new pair still fits.",
   "start": 20.265,
   "end": 21.573
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before laundry day.",
   "start": 22.073,
   "end": 23.686
  }
 ],
